{"id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-evaluation-respecting-per.md","title":"Evaluation-respecting PERs","display":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","aliases":["72-df-evaluation-respecting-per"],"display":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs","depends_on":["[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, E1-E2 and Kleene equality, printed pp.745-746 / PDF pp.757-758","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, E1-E2 and Kleene equality, printed pp.745-746 / PDF pp.757-758"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是闭项集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 是固定求值关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow\">\\(\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v\">\\(t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq T^2\">\\(R\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,r,v,w\\in T\">\\(t,u,r,v,w\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{PER}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a>。下式引入 Kleene 相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、值相容性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span>、集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span> 及任意关系的预求值扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Downarrow}\">\\(R^{\\Downarrow}\\)</span>。这些是元语言关系，不是项语法中的相等公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据p.746明确采用Kleene相等饱和的值相容性：若两个项都无值，它们Kleene相等；若任一有值，两者须得到同一值。确定性和幂等性使 t↓v 蕴涵 t≃v，故该条件包含通常的求值封闭要求。这里没有把“所有项都终止”加入假设，也没有把Kleene相等当作句法相等。预求值扩张中的两个存在见证各自绑定；任意R均可作扩张，未断言任意R的扩张都是PER。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq T^2$，$t,u,r,v,w\\in T$；$\\operatorname{PER}_T$ 见 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。下式引入 Kleene 相等 $\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}$、值相容性 $\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}$、集合 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$ 及任意关系的预求值扩张 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。这些是元语言关系，不是项语法中的相等公式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Downarrow\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,v\\rangle\\in\\Downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v\\land t\\Downarrow w\\Rightarrow v=w","display":false},{"tex":"t\\Downarrow v\\Rightarrow v\\Downarrow v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,r,v,w\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\Downarrow}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall v\\in T\\;((t\\Downarrow v\\lor u\\Downarrow v)\\Rightarrow(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow v)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall t,u,r\\in T\\;(t\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}u\\land \\langle t,r\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow\\langle u,r\\rangle\\in R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T):\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}(R)\\},\\qquad\nR^{\\Downarrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\exists v,w\\in T\\;(t\\Downarrow v\\land u\\Downarrow w\\land vRw)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2535,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per|df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs]]"},{"id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。"},{"id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，以及 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]] 的 $|E|$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-evaluation-respecting-per|df-evaluation-respecting-per — Evaluation-respecting PERs]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"}],"outgoing":["855f0d0656844c14"]}